SUMMARY:Portland-Area Repair Fairs
DESCRIPTION:Need a toy\, household item\, small appliance\, clothing\, etc. repaired? Head to a Repair PDX event and have it come back to life for free! They take place at various locations around the Portland metro area. Visit their calendar to find one near you! \nRPDX Repair Café @ Leaven Common House\nSaturday\, April 11·12:00 – 3:00pm \nHappy Valley Repair Fair\nSaturday\, April 18·10:00am – 1:00pm \nCornelius Public Library Repair Fair\nSaturday\, April 25·1:00 – 4:00pm \nGresham Repair Cafe & Clothing Swap\nSaturday\, May 2·10:00am – 1:00pm \nRPDX Repair Café @ Leaven Common House\nSaturday\, May 9·12:00 – 3:00pm \nLake Oswego Repair Fair\nSaturday\, May 16·10:00am – 1:00pm \nWilsonville Repair Fair\nSaturday\, May 30·10:00am – 1:00pm \nSandy Repair Fair\nSaturday\, June 13·10:00am – 1:00pm \nRPDX Repair Café @ Leaven Common House\nSaturday\, June 13·12:00 – 3:00pm \nForest Grove Library Repair Fair\nSaturday\, June 20·1:00 – 4:00pm \nGarden Home Library Repair Fair\nSaturday\, July 11·11:30am – 2:30pm \nCanby Repair Fair\nSaturday\, July 18·10:00am – 1:00pm \nEstacada Repair Fair\nSaturday\, August 8\, 2026·11:00am – 2:00pm \nSherwood Library Repair Fair\nSaturday\, August 15\, 2026·1:00 – 4:00pm \nRepair Fair at Milwaukie Sustainability Fair\nSaturday\, September 19\, 2026·10:00am – 2:00pm \nCedar Mill Library Repair Fair\nSaturday\, September 26\, 2026·1:00 – 4:00pm \nMolalla Repair fair\nSaturday\, October 10\, 2026·12:00 – 3:00pm \nTualatin Library Repair Fair\nSaturday\, October 17\, 2026·1:00 – 4:00pm \nOregon City Repair Fair\nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026·10:00am – 1:00pm \nRepair Fair at Clackamas Community College\nSaturday\, November 7\, 2026·10:00am – 1:00pm
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/portland-area-repair-fairs/2026-05-16/
