SUMMARY:Period Power Project Community Packing Party
DESCRIPTION:Make kindness tangible—together. Join Positive Charge! PDX’s Period Power Project Community Packing Party and help turn small actions into big impact. Families are invited to assemble period kits or create cards of encouragement that will reach neighbors facing period poverty. It’s a meaningful\, hands-on way to introduce kids to philanthropy while meeting a real and growing need. Children under 14 must be accompanied by an adult. RSVP per person and be part of the change. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
