SUMMARY:March for Babies
DESCRIPTION:More than a yearly walk\, March for Babies is a community. \nFamilies\, friends\, and co-workers can connect while raising critical funds for research\, education\, advocacy\, and programs and services so moms and babies get the best possible start. \nBecause together\, each step forward leads to a healthy future for us all. March for Babies. Every step counts! \nRegister Here: www.marchforbabies.org/event/portland
