SUMMARY:Baby Bonanza with Pediatric Associates of the Northwest
DESCRIPTION:Welcoming a new baby can be an exciting and stressful time. Pediatric Associates of the Northwest recognizes the mix of emotions involved with becoming a parent. That’s why we’re thrilled to invite you to our upcoming Baby Bonanza to learn the essential skills to navigate life with your newborn. \nRegister now for this unique opportunity for new and expectant parents to gather knowledge\, gain insights\, and connect with expert pediatricians\, nurse practitioners\, pediatric psychologists\, and a lactation consultant\, all in a fun and informal community setting. \nBaby Bonanza is FREE\, open to the community\, everyone is invited\, and we are stroller-friendly! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/baby-bonanza-with-pediatric-associates-of-the-northwest/
LOCATION:Pediatric Associates of the Northwest (Portland)\, 2701 NW Vaughn St\, 2nd FLR Atrium\, Portland\, O\, 97210\, United States
