SUMMARY:Volleyball 101: Building your foundation in the game
DESCRIPTION:Ready to step onto the court with confidence? \nIs your child looking for a new way to stay active\, build confidence\, and make friends? At Oregon Junior Volleyball Academy (OJVA)\, we don’t just teach sports—we build athletes. \nOur Volleyball 101 Clinic is specifically designed for 3rd through 8th graders to bridge the gap between “just playing” and “mastering the game.” Whether they are touching a volleyball for the first time or preparing for middle school tryouts\, we provide the elite environment OJVA is known for in a fun\, age-appropriate setting! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/volleyball-101-building-your-foundation-in-the-game/
LOCATION:The Courts in Beaverton\, 14523 SW Millikan Way #110\, Beaverton\, OR 97005\, Beaverton\, OR\, 97008\, United States
CATEGORIES:Active,Indoor,Kids Calendar,Sports
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Volleyball-101-Flyer.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Oregon Juniors Volleyball Academy":MAILTO:jon.ho@ojva.org
END:VEVENT
